 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Before you took your first breath, before you knew the land",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The One who made you, Jacob, held you in his hand",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The One who formed you, Israel, will not let go of you",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He gave Egypt for your ransom, Cush and Seba too",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not be afraid, for I have redeemed you",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I have called you by name; you are mine",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When you pass through the waters, I will be with you",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I have called you by name; you are mine",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When the rivers rise around you and the current pulls you down",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They will not sweep you away, you will not drown",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When you walk through fire, you will not be burned",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The flames will not consume you, he is with you every turn",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
